								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>THAT’S NOT LUCK.</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Blackjack, horse racing, dice, roulette, and slots. Everyone’s trying to win. <strong>One player already knows how</strong>.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >As the <strong>Cheater</strong>, use your glasses to reveal the next winning bet. Try to look surprised when it pays out.<br><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/fa88453fc205b0e55b1ebf7fe05121a2.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/fa88453fc205b0e55b1ebf7fe05121a2.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/fa88453fc205b0e55b1ebf7fe05121a2.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>SECURITY HAS A SHOTGUN</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >One player is the <strong>Security Guard.</strong> Watch the bets, study the players, and work out who’s cheating.<br>Your job ends when you shoot the Cheater. <i>Preferably after some actual detective work. </i><br><i> </i><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/3aa7fef1e3423254ff1c41092b635d5d.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/3aa7fef1e3423254ff1c41092b635d5d.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/3aa7fef1e3423254ff1c41092b635d5d.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >EVERY WIN LEAVES A TRACE.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Guard’s <strong>Casino Trace</strong> scanner watches the whole floor live. Every win shows up the moment it pays out.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >It tells you <strong>where</strong>. Figuring out <i>who</i> is still your job.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d49f5ff7b28984e75888f346d252f4de.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d49f5ff7b28984e75888f346d252f4de.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d49f5ff7b28984e75888f346d252f4de.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>SOME PEOPLE PLAY TO LOSE</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Add the optional <strong>Robber</strong> and <strong>Jester</strong> roles for more suspicious behaviour</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Robber</strong> can steal 40% of another player’s money.</p></li></ul><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>The Jester</strong> wins by losing every chip.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" >Neither wants the Guard confirming their identity.<br><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/13a706d73986d879a5d406370ad44796.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/13a706d73986d879a5d406370ad44796.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/13a706d73986d879a5d406370ad44796.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>TONY WOULD LIKE HIS MONEY BACK</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Running low? Visit <strong>Tony</strong> for a task and a loan. Just remember the interest.<br>His guards will come to collect, and they’re <i>happy to make it personal</i>. <br> <br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/91840db18931c09fcae1c1c1ff03c167.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/91840db18931c09fcae1c1c1ff03c167.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/91840db18931c09fcae1c1c1ff03c167.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>BAD INFLUENCES WELCOME</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Throw bottles</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Pop flashbangs</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Fill the room with smoke</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Make it rain with the Money Gun</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Consume <i>questionable</i> gummies</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d381573ff960436073b949ded4f4f30f.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d381573ff960436073b949ded4f4f30f.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/d381573ff960436073b949ded4f4f30f.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>THE ONLY HONEST TABLE.</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Need a break from all the lying? Grab a cue in the lounge for a round of <strong>8-ball</strong> with real pool physics, 1v1 or 2v2 with your friends.<br><br>Nobody’s cheating here. <i>Probably.</i></p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/84bb6d54da9bb8f47837a3295520e8e5.poster.avif?t=1793163125" width=1170 height=658 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/84bb6d54da9bb8f47837a3295520e8e5.webm?t=1793163125" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127370/extras/84bb6d54da9bb8f47837a3295520e8e5.mp4?t=1793163125" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >SO, WHO’S CHEATING?</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>3 to 8 players</strong> <strong>online</strong></p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Roles:</strong> Innocent Gamblers, the Cheater and the Security Guard, plus the optional Robber and Jester.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong> for lying to each other’s faces.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><i><strong>Everyone’s a suspect. Everyone has an excuse.</strong></i></p>						</div>
					</div>
